<title>GERMANY: Preussag 1995/96 group net falls.</title>
<headline>Preussag 1995/96 group net falls.</headline>
<dateline>HANOVER, Germany 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to September 30, 1995 (in millions of marks unless stated):</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   274     vs 349</p>
<p>    Group ordinary business profit	 468     vs 619</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     430     vs 561</p>
<p>    Group sales				  25,044  vs 26,353</p>
<p>    Group earnings per share (DVFA)	17	vs 28 DM</p>
<p>    Group dividend			     12	vs 12</p>
<p>    Dividend payout			    183     vs 183</p>
<p>    Group incoming orders		    28,537  vs 30,229</p>
<p>    Group orders at hand		     13,989  vs 13,582</p>
<p>    Group investment			   1,359   vs 1,291</p>
<p>    Group depreciation			 1,044   vs 974</p>
<p>    Group total equity			 3,171   vs 3,345</p>
<p>    Group balance sheet total		15,193  vs 15,056</p>
<p>    Group workforce on Sept 30	     66,226  vs 65,227</p>
<p>    Group personnel costs		    5,441   vs 5,481</p>
<p>    Parent net profit			  183     vs 214</p>
<p>    Parent pre-tax profit		    308     vs 300</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of diversified engineering group is Preussag AG.</p>
<p>--Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
